      :motivation "is_safe_path (asl.c:128-135) rejects any path containing .. even when canonical, rejects /tmp scratch roots and Orca sibling worktrees, accepts /projects/asex_probe as inside /projects/asex because the prefix test has no trailing delimiter, and never canonicalises with realpath; ws_root is fixed at startup so ADR-0080 tiers cannot change with directory. visibility_scope.asl (D80) is never invoked. Verified 2026-09-11: (:read mem/src/../README.md) rejected; (:read /Users/purplelephant/projects/asex_probe/s.txt) accepted."
      :purpose "Resolve every path with realpath before checking; treat the boundary as an allowlist of canonical roots: ws_root, registered git worktrees and submodules (D80 tier-workspace-lineage), and declared scratch roots; require a trailing slash delimiter on prefix matches; reject with :ERR_BOUNDARY_VIOLATION only when the canonical path is outside every root; expose the resolved tier in the receipt."
      :context (:contractRef D81PlanContext)
      :outcomes ["Workspace boundary policy: canonical paths, lineage and scratch roots, no prefix collision"]
